OL,3,GNEWSAMan admits causing death of
OL,4,Apedestrian in bus crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has admitted causing death by
OL,7,Fcareless or inconsiderate driving after
OL,8,Fa crash involving a bus and a
OL,9,Fpedestrian.
OL,11,FThe crash - which killed 73-year-old
OL,12,FRichard Parker - happened on Somerford
OL,13,FRoad in Christchurch, Dorset, shortly
OL,14,Fbefore 08:45 BST on 3 December 2025.
OL,16,FNicholas Ouzman, 37, pleaded guilty at
OL,17,FSouthampton Magistrates' Court earlier.
OL,19,FOuzman, of Leavesden in Hertfordshire,
OL,20,Fis due to appear at the same court on 1
OL,21,FDecember to be sentenced.
